# crease: P1 (fold) swept 0 -> 255 while a chord is held, then P2 (bias) 0 -> 255 over the same chord: the tone goes
# from three saws to the folded layer, and from odd-only harmonics to the full set. A pitch bend moves the whole
# voice. The level stays even across the sweep (the crossfade carries its own gain).
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 2.0
track chord
preset 0 128 10 80 220 60 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 128 100 255 0 0
sweep p1 0 255 0 16
note 0 C3 16 100
note 0 E3 16 100
note 0 G3 16 100
note 0 B3 16 100
bend 8 200
bend 12 -200
bend 16 0
sweep p2 0 255 16 32
note 16 C3 16 100
note 16 E3 16 100
note 16 G3 16 100
note 16 B3 16 100
expect sound 0 32
expect idle 70
expect peak_below -6
